\section{Main functions}{

\itemize{
\item \code{\link[=impute_linelist]{impute_linelist()}} imputes missing onsets by back-sampling, a mean
shift, EM back-projection and, given a delay, a forward draw.
\item \code{\link[=delay_pmf]{delay_pmf()}} gives a double interval censored daily Gamma delay pmf.
\item \code{\link[=correct_truncation]{correct_truncation()}} corrects daily onset counts for right
truncation.
\item \code{\link[=weekly]{weekly()}} sums daily counts to weeks.
